      "side": 1,
      "message": "The RPC is named DisconnectNfsv41Client because that is the existing D-Bus method on org.ganesha.nfsd.clientmgr (cltmgr_disconnect_nfsv41_client). Kept the same name so gRPC callers map 1:1.\n\nBehavior is not 4.1-only: destroy_all_client_connections() skips only cid_minorversion \u003d\u003d 0 (NFSv4.0) and destroys session connections for NFSv4.1 and NFSv4.2. The brief comment above the handler was too narrow; I’ve updated it to say that.",
